## CI

The GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/build-test.yml`) runs on
every push and pull request:

| Job | What it does |
|-----|-------------|
| `build-test` | Downloads dependencies, builds static `ltaped` and `ltape`, runs unit tests, runs `go vet`, uploads both binaries as a single `ltape-binaries` artifact |
| `mhvtl-test` | Installs MHVTL, starts the virtual tape daemon, runs `TestMHVTL` if a device appears; marked `continue-on-error: true` because kernel modules may not be available on all CI runners |

